+**Description**  
+All cryptographic operations SHALL use vetted RustCrypto ecosystem crates:
+
+| Primitive | Crate |
+|-----------|-------|
+| AEAD | `chacha20poly1305` |
+| Hash | `sha2` |
+| Base64url | `base64` (general_purpose::URL_SAFE_NO_PAD) |
