+
+**Description**
+The system SHALL expose a `VaultStore` PORT (trait: `put(key, VaultEntry)`, `get(key)`,
+`delete(key)`, `list_keys()`) so vault storage is swappable without changing domain code.
+TWO adapters are provided:
