+   existing `EncryptedBlob`/KMS pipeline); the file holds **no plaintext secrets**.
+   Writes are atomic (write-to-tmp then `fs::rename`).
+   Corrupt files are handled gracefully — `open()` returns `Err` rather than panicking.
